1. Auth Context wraps Zustand provider in your index.jsx
2. In components, use both: `useAuth()` and `useTaskStore()`
3. If you need auth data in a task fetch, pass it from the Context hook to useFetchTasks

Your setup stays clean this way. You're not overthinking it — this is the right call. Ship it.

