"build": "prisma generate && next build"


But in Vercel, you need to ensure `DATABASE_URL` is set in the Environment Variables section of your project settings before the build runs. If you're using a shadow database for migrations, you might also need `PRISMA_SKIP_VALIDATION=true` during the build if you want to skip the actual database connection test.

